<%# Healed Wall add-on block (Bundle C Build 3, 2026-10-28; definition
    in src/lib/healedWall.js). Clearly an optional ADD-ON, never part of
    the tier above. Price is assessed — pending owner strike — so no
    dollar figure appears here: the founding-rate notice stands in. %>
<h2>Optional add-on: the Healed Wall</h2>
<div class="card">
  <h3>The Healed Wall</h3>
  <p>Your clients' healed results, on your storefront: a moderated healed-work wall plus the house aftercare content pack carried under your shop's name, fed by the aftercare check-ins your toolkit already sends. Fresh work sells the appointment — healed work sells the shop.</p>
  <p class="muted"><strong>Founding add-on rate — announced to member shops first</strong></p>
  <p><a class="btn secondary" href="/membership/healed-wall">See the Healed Wall add-on</a></p>
</div>

